  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "This task is to create external, standalone tooling that exports RDF and optionally binaries from a running Fedora repository. ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "The output of running this tooling should result in file on the filesystem structured in the same way as the existing, message-driven tooling persists to disk:",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://github.com/fcrepo4-exts/fcrepo-camel-toolbox/tree/master/fcrepo-serialization"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "https://github.com/fcrepo4-exts/fcrepo-camel-toolbox/tree/master/fcrepo-serialization",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "For context, this export tooling should be able to act as a counterpart to the import tooling defined in this ticket:",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-1990"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-1990",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
