  "description": "<p>This task is to create external, standalone tooling that exports RDF and optionally binaries from a running Fedora repository. <br/>\nThe output of running this tooling should result in file on the filesystem structured in the same way as the existing, message-driven tooling persists to disk:<br/>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4-exts/fcrepo-camel-toolbox/tree/master/fcrepo-serialization\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4-exts/fcrepo-camel-toolbox/tree/master/fcrepo-serialization</a></p>\n\n<p>For context, this export tooling should be able to act as a counterpart to the import tooling defined in this ticket:<br/>\n<a href=\"https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-1990\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-1990</a></p>",
